# No input: keys on the FX track kick the tank, C2 (a thud) to C6 (a crash), soft and hard.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2
track fx2
input silence
param p1 100
param p2 180
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 0 C2 1 127
note 8 C4 1 60
note 16 C6 1 127
note 24 G3 2 100
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
